B.Ur=new A.w(B.Yy,["Salate","echilibrat",4,"https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-de-salate/salata-de-linte-cu-bulgur-si-legume-reteta-mediteraneana.html","Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/linte_bulgur.png",B.Rm,"\u2022 150 g bulgur\n\u2022 150 g linte verde uscat\u0103\n\u2022 300 ml ap\u0103 pentru bulgur; ap\u0103 pentru fierberea lintei\n\u2022 2 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 2 foi dafin\n\u2022 2\u20134 fire ceap\u0103 verde\n\u2022 2 ro\u0219ii\n\u2022 2 ardei kapia\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie mic\u0103\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel, ment\u0103, m\u0103rar\n\u2022 60 ml ulei m\u0103sline\n\u2022 3 linguri crem\u0103 balsamic\u0103, op\u021bional\n\u2022 Coaj\u0103 de l\u0103m\xe2ie netratat\u0103; sucul de la \xbd l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 Sare, piper, sumac","1. Acoper\u0103 bulgurul cu 300 ml ap\u0103 clocotit\u0103 s\u0103rat\u0103, 15\u201330 minute. Separat, fierbe lintea cu usturoiul \u0219i dafinul 20\u201330 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeenmoaie f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se destrame. Scurge \u0219i elimin\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i dafinul.\n2. Taie legumele \u0219i verdea\u021ba. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 partea foarte apoas\u0103 a ro\u0219iilor.\n3. Combin\u0103 lintea, bulgurul \u0219i legumele bine scurse. Adaug\u0103 uleiul, l\u0103m\xe2ia \u0219i crema balsamic\u0103 dup\u0103 gust; amestec\u0103.\n4. Las\u0103 30 minute la frigider. Serve\u0219te cu sumac dup\u0103 gust.",15,25,"30 min r\u0103cire, \xeen plus fa\u021b\u0103 de cele 40 min declarate de surs\u0103.","Gr\xe2u (gluten); verific\u0103 crema balsamic\u0103.",5,16,"Leguminoase, cereale \u0219i legume","\xcemparte preparatul \xeen por\u021biile indicate \u0219i m\u0103soar\u0103 uleiul."],t.R)
