B.WI=new A.w(B.Yq,["Salate","echilibrat",4,"https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-diverse/salata-de-naut-cu-avocado.html","Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/naut_avocado.png",B.RD,"\u2022 1 conserv\u0103 n\u0103ut fiert, scurs\n\u2022 50 g cu\u0219cu\u0219\n\u2022 100 ml ap\u0103 clocotit\u0103\n\u2022 1 c\u0103\u021bel usturoi\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie mic\u0103\n\u2022 2 ro\u0219ii\n\u2022 1 castravete\n\u2022 1 avocado\n\u2022 50 ml ulei m\u0103sline\n\u2022 Sucul unei l\u0103m\xe2i mari\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel, ment\u0103, sare, piper; ardei iute op\u021bional","1. Acoper\u0103 cu\u0219cu\u0219ul cu 100 ml ap\u0103 clocotit\u0103 u\u0219or s\u0103rat\u0103. A\u0219teapt\u0103 2\u20133 minute p\xe2n\u0103 absoarbe apa; af\xe2neaz\u0103.\n2. Scurge n\u0103utul. Amestec\u0103 usturoiul zdrobit cu uleiul \u0219i pu\u021bin\u0103 sare, apoi cu n\u0103utul.\n3. Taie legumele \u0219i avocado. Combin\u0103 cu n\u0103utul, cu\u0219cu\u0219ul \u0219i zeama de l\u0103m\xe2ie.\n4. Adaug\u0103 verdea\u021ba tocat\u0103, potrive\u0219te gustul \u0219i serve\u0219te imediat.",10,0,10,!0,"N\u0103ut deja fiert; este necesar\u0103 ap\u0103 clocotit\u0103.","Gr\xe2u (gluten) din cu\u0219cu\u0219.",4.9,46,"Mas\u0103 vegetal\u0103","N\u0103utul aduce leguminoase, iar legumele diversitate. Apa clocotit\u0103 \xeenseamn\u0103 c\u0103 re\u021beta nu este complet f\u0103r\u0103 \xeenc\u0103lzire."],t.R)
