B.U_=new A.w(B.YM,["Mic dejun","echilibrat",2,"https://www.e-retete.ro/retete/budinca-cremoasa-de-ovaz-cu-mere","Ioana \xb7 e-Retete","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/ovaz_mere.png",B.RL,"\u2022 100 g fulgi mici ov\u0103z\n\u2022 10 g semin\u021be in m\u0103cinate\n\u2022 300 g lapte\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oar\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 miere\n\u2022 100 g iaurt grecesc 2%\n\u2022 2 mere mici dulci\n\u2022 Pu\u021bin unt pentru tigaie","1. Fierbe ov\u0103zul \u0219i inul \xeen lapte la foc mic circa 5 minute, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeengroa\u0219\u0103. Separat paseaz\u0103 un m\u0103r cu iaurtul.\n2. Ia ov\u0103zul de pe foc. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 mierea, pu\u021bin\u0103 scor\u021bi\u0219oar\u0103 \u0219i amestecul de m\u0103r cu iaurt.\n3. Taie cel\u0103lalt m\u0103r cuburi. \xcenmoaie \xeen tigaia uns\u0103 cu unt circa 3 minute; adaug\u0103 restul scor\u021bi\u0219oarei \u0219i mai las\u0103 30 secunde.\n4. \xcemparte ov\u0103zul \xeen dou\u0103 boluri \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 merele calde deasupra.",!0,"Lapte; ov\u0103z \u2014 verific\u0103 eticheta pentru gluten.","Fierbere circa 5 min; mere \xeen tigaie circa 3\xbd min, plus preg\u0103tire.","Mic dejun","Ov\u0103z, fruct \u0219i iaurt \xeentr-un bol. Mierea este tot zah\u0103r liber: m\u0103soar-o."],t.R)
