B.Qm=s(["cartofi","branza","bacon"],t.s)
B.UH=new A.w(B.Ys,["Fel Principal","clasic",null,"https://savoriurbane.com/cartofi-umpluti-cu-branza/","Savori Urbane","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/cartofi_umpluti.png",B.Qm,"\u2022 16\u201320 cartofi noi medii\n\u2022 100 g br\xe2nz\u0103 vaci\n\u2022 1 ou\n\u2022 50 g cheddar\n\u2022 50 g ca\u0219caval tip Trappist\n\u2022 20 felii mici bacon\n\u2022 Sare, piper, chimen","1. Spal\u0103 cartofii noi. Scobe\u0219te cu un dispozitiv potrivit sau \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te \u0219i scoate pu\u021bin miez, p\u0103str\xe2nd pere\u021bii \xeentregi.\n2. Amestec\u0103 br\xe2nzeturile cu oul \u0219i condimentele.\n3. Pune o feliu\u021b\u0103 de bacon \xeen fiecare cavitate, apoi umple cu br\xe2nz\u0103. A\u0219az\u0103 \xeentr-o tav\u0103 ad\xe2nc\u0103.\n4. Coace 20 minute la 180\xb0C, apoi 5\u201310 minute la 160\xb0C. Furculi\u021ba trebuie s\u0103 intre u\u0219or \xeen cartof \u0219i umplutura s\u0103 fie \xeenchegat\u0103; prelunge\u0219te dac\u0103 este necesar.",15,"Lapte, ou; verific\u0103 baconul.",5,2,"Sursa indic\u0103 5\u20136 por\u021bii. Coacere 25\u201330 min, plus preg\u0103tire; pentru ajustare alege mai \xeent\xe2i baza de por\u021bii."],t.R)
