B.S6=s(["ton","porumb","ceapa","lamaie","masline","ulei"],t.s)
B.Uk=new A.w(B.Z6,["Salate","https://unsplash.com",B.S6,"\u2022 2 conserve ton \xeen suc propriu sau ulei (scurs), 1 conserv\u0103 mic\u0103 porumb dulce, 1 ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie, 50g m\u0103sline felii, sucul de la jum\u0103tate de l\u0103m\xe2ie, 1 lingur\u0103 ulei m\u0103sline, sare.","1. Scurge bine tonul din conserv\u0103 \u0219i m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te-l u\u0219or cu o furculi\u021b\u0103 \xeentr-un bol.\n2. Pune porumbul dulce scurs de zeam\u0103 \u0219i sp\u0103lat.\n3. Ad\u0103ug\u0103 ceapa ro\u0219ie t\u0103iat\u0103 cubule\u021be foarte mici \u0219i m\u0103slinele.\n4. \xcentr-un pahar, amestec\u0103 sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie cu uleiul de m\u0103sline \u0219i sarea, apoi toarn\u0103 peste salat\u0103 \u0219i omogenizeaz\u0103.","Dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti ton \xeen ulei, folose\u0219te chiar uleiul din conserv\u0103 \xeen loc s\u0103 \xeel arunci! Are o arom\u0103 intens\u0103 de pe\u0219te care va \xeembr\u0103ca boabele de porumb mult mai gustos."],t.R)
B.Rs=s(["salata verde","ceapa verde","marar","ulei","lamaie"],t.s)
B.V8=new A.w(B.l,["Salate","https://unsplash.com",B.Rs,"\u2022 1 salat\u0103 verde mare (sau un pachet mix de frunze), 2 fire ceap\u0103 verde, jum\u0103tate de leg\u0103tur\u0103 m\u0103rar, 2 linguri ulei, 1 lingur\u0103 o\u021bet (sau l\u0103m\xe2ie), sare.","1. Spal\u0103 frunzele de salat\u0103 una c\xe2te una \xeen ap\u0103 rece \u0219i usuc\u0103-le foarte bine (sau folose\u0219te o centrifug\u0103 de salat\u0103).\n2. Rupe frunzele cu m\xe2na \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi potrivite (nu le t\u0103ia cu cu\u021bitul).\n3. Toac\u0103 ceapa verde rondele \u0219i m\u0103rarul fin, apoi adaug\u0103-le peste salat\u0103.\n4. Strope\u0219te cu ulei, o\u021bet \u0219i presar\u0103 sarea chiar \xeenainte de a o pune pe mas\u0103.","Ruperea frunzelor de salat\u0103 cu m\xe2na \xeen loc de t\u0103ierea cu cu\u021bitul de metal opre\u0219te ruginirea (oxidarea) marginilor, men\u021bin\xe2nd salata proasp\u0103t\u0103 \u0219i crocant\u0103 mult mai mult timp."],t.R)
B.Os=s(["ridichi","ceapa verde","ulei","otel"],t.s)
B.Wr=new A.w(B.l,["Salate","https://unsplash.com",B.Os,"\u2022 2 leg\u0103turi de ridichi ro\u0219ii proaspete, 3 fire ceap\u0103 verde, 2 linguri ulei de floarea soarelui, 1 lingur\u0103 o\u021bet clasic, sare.","1. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 ridichile, spal\u0103-le bine \u0219i taie-le \xeen rondele foarte sub\u021biri.\n2. Toac\u0103 firele de ceap\u0103 verde cu tot cu frunze \xeen rondele sub\u021biri.\n3. Pune-le \xeempreun\u0103 \xeentr-un bol mic.\n4. Ad\u0103ug\u0103 uleiul, o\u021betul \u0219i sarea, amestec\xe2nd bine ca ridichile s\u0103 \xee\u0219i lase pu\u021bin\u0103 zeam\u0103 dulceag\u0103.","Aceasta este salata perfect\u0103 de prim\u0103var\u0103 care merge la fix l\xe2ng\u0103 o omlet\u0103 cald\u0103 sau stufat de miel. Consum-o imediat dup\u0103 preparare, altfel ridichile \xee\u0219i pierd rigiditatea."],t.R)
