B.U9=new A.w(B.cw,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,15,20,274,30,B.O0,"\u2022 340g piept de pui f\u0103r\u0103 piele, f\xe2\u0219ii\n\u2022 aprox. 240 g ro\u0219ii decojite, tocate, cu suc\n\u2022 240 ml sos chili cu c\xe2t mai pu\u021bin\u0103 sare\n\u2022 aprox. 225 g ardei verde tocat\n\u2022 aprox. 150 g \u021belin\u0103 apio tocat\u0103\n\u2022 aprox. 40 g ceap\u0103 tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 usturoi tocat\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 busuioc proasp\u0103t sau 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 uscat\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 p\u0103trunjel proasp\u0103t sau 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 uscat\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 fulgi de ardei iute\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 Spray de g\u0103tit, pentru tigaie","1. Pulverizeaz\u0103 tigaia cu spray \u0219i \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te-o. G\u0103te\u0219te puiul 3\u20135 minute, amestec\xe2nd.\n2. Redu focul. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile cu suc, sosul chili, legumele, verde\u021burile, ardeiul iute \u0219i sarea. Adu la fierbere.\n3. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i fierbe domol 10 minute. Verific\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103tirea complet\u0103 a puiului.","Orezul sugerat la servire \xeen surs\u0103 este o garnitur\u0103 separat\u0103.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/20-minute-chicken-creole","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","\u021aelin\u0103. Verific\u0103 \u0219i ingredientele sosului chili.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
