B.Ub=new A.w(B.cw,["echilibrat","Salate",6,10,0,138,3,B.PF,"\u2022 1 m\u0103r Granny Smith cu coaj\u0103, feliat\n\u2022 2 linguri suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 aprox. 180 g salat\u0103 verde cu frunze, sp\u0103lat\u0103 \u0219i t\u0103iat\u0103 lejer\n\u2022 aprox. 60 g meri\u0219oare uscate, ne\xeendesate\n\u2022 aprox. 30 g nuci tocate\n\u2022 aprox. 35 g miez de semin\u021be de floarea-soarelui nes\u0103rat\n\u2022 80 ml vinegret\u0103 de zmeur\u0103 cu gr\u0103sime redus\u0103","1. Strope\u0219te m\u0103rul feliat cu sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie.\n2. Combin\u0103 frunzele, meri\u0219oarele, m\u0103rul, nucile \u0219i semin\u021bele.\n3. Adaug\u0103 vinegreta \u0219i amestec\u0103 u\u0219or. \xcemparte \xeen 6 por\u021bii.","Valorile publicate se refer\u0103 la vinegreta indicat\u0103 \xeen surs\u0103. Un alt sos schimb\u0103 valorile.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/autumn-salad","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Nuci. Verific\u0103 eticheta vinegretei.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
