B.U8=new A.w(B.cw,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,10,30,242,20,B.O4,"\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei de m\u0103sline\n\u2022 283g ciuperci albe, sferturi\n\u2022 aprox. 90 g praz crud, cur\u0103\u021bat \u0219i t\u0103iat\n\u2022 aprox. 150 g cartofi cruzi, cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi \u0219i t\u0103ia\u021bi cuburi\n\u2022 aprox. 100 g \u021belin\u0103 apio tocat\u0103\n\u2022 aprox. 130 g cepe perlate congelate\n\u2022 720 ml sup\u0103 de pui cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare\n\u2022 454g pulpe de pui f\u0103r\u0103 piele\n\u2022 C\xe2te 2 linguri p\u0103trunjel \u0219i arpagic proasp\u0103t tocat\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 amidon de porumb\n\u2022 2 linguri sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 gr\u0103sime\n\u2022 \xbd linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 piper","1. La cuptor: 175\xb0C. \xcen vas termorezistent, rumene\u0219te ciupercile \xeen ulei 3\u20135 minute; adaug\u0103 legumele \xeenc\u0103 3\u20135 minute.\n2. Adaug\u0103 supa; la fierbere pune puiul. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i coace aproximativ 20 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 atinge minimum 74\xb0C \xeen interior.\n3. Scoate puiul. Fierbe sosul cu verde\u021burile \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ia. Adaug\u0103 amidonul cu sm\xe2nt\xe2na, readu la fierbere \u0219i opre\u0219te focul.\n4. Asezoneaz\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te sosul peste pui.","Folose\u0219te vas \u0219i capac rezistente la cuptor.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/chicken-and-mushroom-fricassee","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Lapte \u0219i \u021belin\u0103; verific\u0103 eticheta supei.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
