B.Uz=new A.w(B.YX,["clasic","Aperitive / Gust\u0103ri","Laura Lauren\u021biu","https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-diverse/sos-tzatziki.html","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.P9,"\u2022 200 g iaurt grecesc cremos\n\u2022 2 castrave\u021bi medii, aproximativ 250 g\n\u2022 Suc de la \xbd l\u0103m\xe2ie, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 1\u20132 c\u0103\u021bei de usturoi\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei de m\u0103sline extravirgin\n\u2022 1 leg\u0103tur\u0103 mic\u0103 m\u0103rar\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust","1. Spal\u0103 castrave\u021bii, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 centrul cu semin\u021be \u0219i rade sau feliaz\u0103 pulpa. Presar\u0103 sare \u0219i las\u0103 10 minute s\u0103 elimine ap\u0103.\n2. Toac\u0103 m\u0103rarul \u0219i zdrobe\u0219te usturoiul. Dac\u0103 iaurtul are zer \xeen exces, scurge-l.\n3. Scurge bine castrave\u021bii. Amestec\u0103-i cu iaurtul, m\u0103rarul, usturoiul, uleiul \u0219i sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie.\n4. Gust\u0103 \xeenainte de a completa sarea \u0219i piperul. Serve\u0219te ca sos sau aperitiv.","Cele 20 de minute publicate de surs\u0103 includ repausul de 10 minute al castrave\u021bilor.","Lapte \xeen iaurt.",!0,2,20,0,20,!0,"10 minute pentru scurgerea castrave\u021bilor, incluse \xeen total",!0,B.Sj,150,4.9,95],t.R)
